        {"scholar": "Principe, Lawrence", "reference": "The Secrets of Alchemy. Chicago: University of Chicago Press, 2013, pp. 106–145.", "quote": "The pursuit of the physical Stone was not a cover story for spiritual goals but a genuine experimental programme prosecuted by rigorous practitioners."},
